  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_00",
      "hash64": "D1EDE1F9BC47230F",
      "text": "哎呀，你……看起来\\n在前世有过很多经历哦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_01",
      "hash64": "D1EDE0F9BC47215C",
      "text": "通过手机占卜前世的记忆，\\n我称其为“手机占卜”，你要不要试试？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_02",
      "hash64": "D1EDE3F9BC472675",
      "text": "我果然让人觉得很可疑啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_03",
      "hash64": "D1EDE2F9BC4724C2",
      "text": "回溯你前世的记忆……！\\n你曾经生活的地方是……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_028_select_a",
      "hash64": "35D0BFAD69D0E96D",
      "text": "关都地区？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_028_select_b",
      "hash64": "35D0BCAD69D0E454",
      "text": "伽勒尔地区？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_028_select_c",
      "hash64": "35D0BDAD69D0E607",
      "text": "神奥地区？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_028_select_d",
      "hash64": "35D0BAAD69D0E0EE",
      "text": "洗翠地区？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_028_select_e",
      "hash64": "35D0BBAD69D0E2A1",
      "text": "还是算了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_04",
      "hash64": "D1EDDDF9BC471C43",
      "text": "嗯嗯！你前世\\n留下足迹的地方就是……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_a",
      "hash64": "036CE3FECEFF3FC2",
      "text": "没错，没错！\\n你曾经在关都地区\\r\\n和搭档宝可梦Let's Go！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_b",
      "hash64": "036CE2FECEFF3E0F",
      "text": "没错，没错！\\n你曾经在伽勒尔地区不断挑战，\\r\\n还让宝可梦极巨化！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_c",
      "hash64": "036CE1FECEFF3C5C",
      "text": "没错，没错！\\n你曾经在神奥地区钻入地下，\\r\\n还参加超级华丽大赛！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_d",
      "hash64": "036CE0FECEFF3AA9",
      "text": "没错，没错！\\n你曾经在洗翠地区\\r\\n拿着神秘的手机进行大冒险！\\r\\n……话说洗翠地区是哪里啊！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_05",
      "hash64": "D1EDDCF9BC471A90",
      "text": "……依照你的记忆，\\n我来给你制作手机壳吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_06",
      "hash64": "D1EDDFF9BC471FA9",
      "text": "嘿呀！嘿呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_07",
      "hash64": "D1EDDEF9BC471DF6",
      "text": "……做好了。\\n请拿去用吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sub_028_system_a",
      "hash64": "4AF36B673E33A1D0",
