    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_08",
      "hash64": "D1EDE9F9BC4730A7",
      "text": "如果你想知道其他的前世，\\n就再来找我吧……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_09",
      "hash64": "D1EDE8F9BC472EF4",
      "text": "我还是第一次遇到像你这样的人，\\n经历了如此丰富多彩的前世。\\r\\n谢谢你愿意让我占卜。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_10",
      "hash64": "D1EA5BF9BC440986",
      "text": "前世的记忆手机壳，\\n你在使用吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
